        const prompt = `You are a master STEM pedagogue creating a 1-page remedial practice worksheet for high school students struggling with the curriculum concept: "${conceptTitle}" in ${subject || 'STEM'}.
Provide clear LaTeX formatting with $...$ for inline equations and $$...$$ for display equations.
Respond ONLY with valid JSON in this exact structure:
